note: numbers within a relative 1e-9 of each other count as equal
say 0.1 plus 0.2
say 0.1 plus 0.2 is 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 is not 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 equals 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 is equal to 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 = 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 == 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 != 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 isn't 0.3
note: the ordering comparisons agree with "is"
say 0.1 plus 0.2 is at most 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 is at least 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 is greater than 0.3
say 0.1 plus 0.2 is less than 0.3
say -0.1 plus -0.2 is -0.3
note: the tolerance is relative to the larger number
say 1 is 1.0000000001
say 1 is 1.00001
say 0 is 0.000000000001
say 1000000000 is 1000000000.5
say 1 divided by 3 times 3 is 1
